{"title":"2025 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3_by_Thinking_Feet\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3 by Thinking Feet</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(Quick,_fast,_easy!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(Quick, fast, easy!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is inserted into the list <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/9265f5dd6dade78136a6be158ace46bf7c0f8ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The mean is now twice as great as the median. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/b/23b7927a41b7f562d8d4a5b386bb8fbee30ea1f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 7\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 14\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 20\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 28\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Median\" title=\"Median\">median</a> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since the mean is two times as great as the median, the mean must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/1/011130041916b5178c5be06c6b3baeef973d6c40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 \\times 2 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />. The sum of the numbers without <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/8/5a88ed860dc2a3c98ee85be5fb4f1d2acce486c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 6 + 7 + 7 + 28 = 8 + 14 + 28 = 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"302\" height=\"15\" />. Using the sum, we then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/e/ceea4db9d53fd971457348dcfe585235f798da59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{N + 50}{6} = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"39\" />. \n</p><p>Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f3707f46e1964145e5d36225fb94c800d1d607fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N + 50 = 14 \\times 6 = 84$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"175\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/f/4cf473c82257993426777dde7fa8fda736769d5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 84 - 50 = \\boxed{\\text{(E)\\ 34}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"183\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~pereena and edited by anabel.disher four times\n</p><p>The median of the list is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so the mean of the new list will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/9/e9993a3622c754324be3257853b1c5aef889ae4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 \\cdot 2 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" />. Since there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers in the new list, the sum of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/0/670427d4c77eeaf7eab75e87d5b5ec5e002487c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14 \\cdot 6 = 84$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/a/2eaec0d552eb7b73419522b79336b90f57418a11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+6+7+7+28+N = 84 \\implies N = \\boxed{\\text{(E)\\ 34}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"374\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~Soupboy0\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the average right now is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and the median is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> must be larger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, which means that the median of the 6 resulting numbers should be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, making the mean of these <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. We can do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/2/2f22e234118405812c4b643d37f8878ccdf08353.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 6 + 7 + 7 + 28 + N = 14 * 6 = 84$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"295\" height=\"16\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/e/60ee863add2f7e3717e879d510a2b7e008efec9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50 + N = 84$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfdaa6681fd4fb1f2fd457a99d74b63540a0eb8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(E)\\ 34}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"59\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~Sigmacuber\n</p><p>i feel this explanation doesn’t make much sense ~anonymous\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/b/66bf129ced85c13766931a9c727102b10c07f555.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{This explanation could be better explained ~anonymous}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"407\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We try out every option by inserting each number into the list. After trying out each number, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfdaa6681fd4fb1f2fd457a99d74b63540a0eb8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(E)\\ 34}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"59\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>Note that this is very time-consuming and it is not the most practical solution.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/7/077bb744456edff865f6a063f4b5bcee26766d5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$~$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"7\" height=\"2\" />\n~codegirl2013\n~Minor edit by KangarooPrecise\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We could use answer choices to solve this problem. The sum of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. If you add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to the list, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/1/4b14ef560acadba8244952e9a8d5481f494445dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$57$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is not divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, therefore it will not work. Same thing applies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The only possible choices left are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/9265f5dd6dade78136a6be158ace46bf7c0f8ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d037f1aa313d30fe7ade693f1b672ed2a68880fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Now you check <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/9265f5dd6dade78136a6be158ace46bf7c0f8ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. You see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/9265f5dd6dade78136a6be158ace46bf7c0f8ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> doesn't work because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/790849bd0e8381b4ac7dce267c41c8cc30633646.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(28+50) \\div 6 = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"148\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is not twice of the median, which is still <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, only choice left is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfdaa6681fd4fb1f2fd457a99d74b63540a0eb8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(E)\\ 34}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"59\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~ HydroMathGod\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that in the list, both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />rd and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />th. So, no matter what number we plug in, we will have two <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />rd and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />th. So, the median will always be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. That means we have to find the option that makes the mean <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. If the mean is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, the sum of all the six numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/3/4131457f67c5dbfd8b1c6be1f74a47595a9bd3be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$84$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />. The sum of the five numbers we are given is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfdaa6681fd4fb1f2fd457a99d74b63540a0eb8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(E)\\ 34}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"59\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~ sdmd\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_.28First_fully_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/VUL0T0YEAHk?si=GLCAr4PZVAVwp-3A&amp;t=3575\">https://youtu.be/VUL0T0YEAHk?si=GLCAr4PZVAVwp-3A&amp;t=3575</a>\n~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/VUL0T0YEAHk?si=GLCAr4PZVAVwp-3A&amp;t=3575\">https://youtu.be/VUL0T0YEAHk?si=GLCAr4PZVAVwp-3A&amp;t=3575</a>\n~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution 2 by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jTTcscvcQmI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jTTcscvcQmI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3_by_Thinking_Feet\">Video Solution 3 by Thinking Feet</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3 by Thinking Feet\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/PKMpTS6b988\">https://youtu.be/PKMpTS6b988</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.28Quick.2C_fast.2C_easy.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(Quick